{"seq":2,"slug":"representment-case-win-rate","title":"representment 文案策略与胜诉率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-representment/representment-case-win-rate","wordCount":1836,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"representment-文案策略与胜诉率\">representment 文案策略与胜诉率</h1><p>应诉文案是唯一一处&quot;由人写给发卡行审核员看&quot;的环节，也最容易被误写成辩解信。审核员的实际工作方式是：在几百份答复里快速定位能与网络理由码对上的论据，找不到就直接判负。因此文案的目标不是说服，而是<strong>让正确的证据在正确的理由码下被一眼看到</strong>。写长了是负数，写偏了直接作废，写全文政策等于没写。这一章讨论三件事：文案怎么写、胜诉率怎么估、什么时候干脆不应诉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-文案的三条硬规则\">核心概念：文案的三条硬规则</h2><p>文案的产出不是一段文字，而是一条从&quot;争议到达&quot;到&quot;提交或接受&quot;的判定链。三步各自决定不同的结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[争议到达] --&gt; B[读理由码与客户主张]&#10;  B --&gt; C{证据强度可否支撑胜诉?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[接受争议, 释放人力]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[按理由码选证据模板]&#10;  E --&gt; F[按标签归类, 合并同标签文件]&#10;  F --&gt; G[写定性反驳: 时间线+证据引用]&#10;  G --&gt; H[控制长度: 只留相关片段]&#10;  H --&gt; I[提交, 进入 under_review]&#10;  I --&gt; J{60-75 天后裁决}&#10;  J --&gt;|won| K[退还应诉费与争议金额]&#10;  J --&gt;|lost| L[金额终局归持卡人]\">graph TD\n  A[争议到达] --&gt; B[读理由码与客户主张]\n  B --&gt; C{证据强度可否支撑胜诉?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[接受争议, 释放人力]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[按理由码选证据模板]\n  E --&gt; F[按标签归类, 合并同标签文件]\n  F --&gt; G[写定性反驳: 时间线+证据引用]\n  G --&gt; H[控制长度: 只留相关片段]\n  H --&gt; I[提交, 进入 under_review]\n  I --&gt; J{60-75 天后裁决}\n  J --&gt;|won| K[退还应诉费与争议金额]\n  J --&gt;|lost| L[金额终局归持卡人]</pre><p>Stripe 给出的实操准则可以收敛成三条：<strong>对齐理由码</strong>、<strong>控制长度</strong>、<strong>按标签归类</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对齐理由码\">对齐理由码</h3><p>最常见的错误是答非所问。举例：网络理由码是&quot;已取消的商品&quot;，若客户未按取消政策操作，你应当只提交<strong>取消政策的相关章节</strong>，而不是整份服务条款。同理，客户以&quot;完全没收到货&quot;为由发起拒付时，提交一份清晰列明的退款政策是无用的——政策回应的是&quot;有缺陷/与描述不符&quot;类主张（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。理由码与证据模板的映射关系见 <a href=\"../chargeback-mechanism/reason-code-taxonomy\">拒付理由码体系（欺诈/授权/消费争议）</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"控制长度\">控制长度</h3><p>长文件不会更有说服力。Stripe 明确写道：发卡行审核员不会通读一份冗长文件去寻找与理由码相关的论点；过多无关内容反而可能<strong>损害</strong>商户的主张（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。具体到操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只粘贴服务条款的相关段落，用下划线或箭头标出客户违反的具体条款；</li>\n<li>邮件、短信沟通只保留相关片段，重复内容要隐藏；</li>\n<li>截图只截取目标区域，用圆圈标出关键元素（如签收确认）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"定性反驳的模板\">定性反驳的模板</h3><p>定性反驳应该是事实性的、业务化的、简洁的，并且<strong>明确指向证据</strong>。Stripe 给的范例结构是：&quot;某人于某日以某卡购买某物；如所附跟踪文件所示，我们于某日发货、于某日送达指定地址；因此&#39;未收到&#39;的主张不属实。&quot;</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Jenny Rosen 于 2026-08-14 用 Visa 卡购买 Widget ABC 一件。&#10;如所附 tracking.pdf 所示，我们于 2026-08-15 发货至其账单地址，&#10;于 2026-08-19 由承运商签收（见第 2 页签名屏）。购买 IP 与&#10;该账单地址所属州一致，CVC 校验通过。&#39;未收到商品&#39;的主张不成立。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Jenny Rosen 于 2026-08-14 用 Visa 卡购买 Widget ABC 一件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如所附 tracking.pdf 所示，我们于 2026-08-15 发货至其账单地址，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>于 2026-08-19 由承运商签收（见第 2 页签名屏）。购买 IP 与</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>该账单地址所属州一致，CVC 校验通过。'未收到商品'的主张不成立。</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四条要素：<strong>时间线</strong>、<strong>证据引用</strong>、<strong>逐条反驳主张</strong>、<strong>中性语气</strong>。中性很重要——指责持卡人欺诈对裁决没有帮助，只描述事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"胜诉率的估算与用法\">胜诉率的估算与用法</h2><p>胜诉率不是一个统计量，而是一个<strong>分层决策变量</strong>。Stripe 给出按证据强度分层的翻盘概率，并明确指出：即便在最有利的情形下，推翻已拒付的支付也非常困难。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评分</th>\n<th>翻盘概率</th>\n<th>应诉动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5 点</td>\n<td>约 60%</td>\n<td>必应诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 点</td>\n<td>约 40%</td>\n<td>应诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 点</td>\n<td>约 25%</td>\n<td>视金额而定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 点</td>\n<td>约 15%</td>\n<td>通常接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 点</td>\n<td>约 5%</td>\n<td>接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）</p>\n<h3 id=\"从概率到经济决策\">从概率到经济决策</h3><p>把概率与成本放在一起，应诉与否就有了可计算的判据。设争议金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，应诉费为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，胜诉可得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（应诉费退还），负则损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；期望收益为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>应诉</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{应诉}] = p\\,(A + F_r) - (1-p)\\,F_r = pA + (2p-1)F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应诉</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不应诉的期望恒定为零增量。因此<strong>应诉的临界胜率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &gt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></strong>——这看似反直觉（直觉上只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pA &gt; F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就该应诉），但忽略了应诉费在胜诉时会退还，使得胜诉的回报包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，败诉的代价也是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 附近抵消。实务上还须叠加客户关系与内部人力成本，因此常见阈值设在 0.6 到 0.7。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def should_represent(amount, fee, p_win, labor_cost, accept_ratio=0.65):&#10;    if p_win &lt; accept_ratio:&#10;        return (&quot;accept&quot;, &quot;证据强度不足，人力更值得投到预防&quot;)&#10;    ev = p_win * amount + (2 * p_win - 1) * fee - labor_cost&#10;    return (&quot;represent&quot;, f&quot;期望收益 {ev:.2f}&quot;) if ev &gt; 0 else (&quot;accept&quot;, &quot;负期望&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> should_represent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, fee, p_win, labor_cost, accept_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_win </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accept_ratio:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"证据强度不足，人力更值得投到预防\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_win </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_win </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labor_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"represent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"期望收益 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"负期望\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"概率估计的输入\">概率估计的输入</h3><p>翻盘概率的估计应来自历史数据而非主观。可按 <code>(network, reasonCode, evidence_bundle_signature)</code> 分组统计历史胜率，再用贝叶斯平滑避免小样本失真：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT network, reason_code,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;won&#39;) AS wins,&#10;       count(*) AS total,&#10;       -- 拉普拉斯平滑，避免 0/0 与极端值&#10;       (count(*) FILTER (WHERE stage = &#39;won&#39;) + 1.0) / (count(*) + 2.0) AS p_win&#10;FROM dispute&#10;WHERE stage IN (&#39;won&#39;,&#39;lost&#39;) AND created_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;180 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY network, reason_code&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network, reason_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'won'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 拉普拉斯平滑，避免 0/0 与极端值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'won'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_win</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'won'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network, reason_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>evidence_bundle_signature</code> 是关键维度：它记录&quot;证据包里有哪些决定性标签&quot;。同一理由码下，有 CE3.0 与没有 CE3.0 的胜率可能相差数倍，把两者混在一起统计会得出无用的均值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高效与低效文案的对照\">高效与低效文案的对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>低效</th>\n<th>高效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>政策材料</td>\n<td>上传整份 ToS</td>\n<td>只截取相关章节并标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通记录</td>\n<td>整段长邮件线程</td>\n<td>仅相关片段，去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截图</td>\n<td>全屏、缩略不可读</td>\n<td>裁剪目标区 + 圆圈标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用方式</td>\n<td>链接到外部网盘</td>\n<td>直接嵌入文件（审核员不看链接）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语气</td>\n<td>指责欺诈</td>\n<td>中性陈述事实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>数十页</td>\n<td>一页定性反驳 + 必要附件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（依据 <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe: Responding to disputes</a>）</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的细节是：外部链接一律不要放。Stripe 明确指出，审核员不会检查外部内容，因此不要包含音频/视频、不要请求审核员通过电话或邮箱联系你、不要放&quot;点击查看详情&quot;的链接（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe: Responding to disputes</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接受争议也是一种策略\">接受争议也是一种策略</h2><p>接受争议（accept）并不被视为承认欺诈，且不影响拒付受理费的计算——因为拒付率统计的是&quot;申请件数&quot;而非&quot;判负件数&quot;（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。这一点决定了接受策略的定位：它是一个<strong>节流阀</strong>，把有限的人力从低胜率争议中释放出来。</p>\n<p>但接受策略有一个例外必须避免误用——<strong>客户愿意撤销争议时仍应提交证据</strong>。持卡人可以向银行声明撤回争议，但你仍应提交材料证明支付正当，以确保发卡行清楚你不接受该争议；而当商户认为资金本该退给客户时，正确做法是接受争议，而不是要求客户撤回（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。原因同上：撤回的争议也计数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"部分退款场景的答复\">部分退款场景的答复</h3><p>若争议前已做部分退款，客户仍争全额，答复中必须包含已执行部分退款的证据（金额、退款日、以及控制台退款信息的截图），这被称为&quot;已发放退款&quot;答复。发卡行通常会取消原拒付并另行创建一笔修正金额的拒付。极端但不罕见的情形下，会出现&quot;退得比原购买还多&quot;的结果——Stripe 坦言这在部分退款场景中可能出现，但仍应始终履行责任，因为发卡行倾向于解决该问题（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>文案三规则：对齐理由码、控制长度、按标签归类；答非所问是最常见且最贵的失误。</li>\n<li>定性反驳模板四要素：时间线、证据引用、逐条反驳、中性语气。</li>\n<li>翻盘概率按证据强度分层，从约 60% 到约 5%；应诉的临界胜率约为 0.5（考虑应诉费退还后），实务阈值常设在 0.6–0.7。</li>\n<li>概率估计应按 <code>(network, reasonCode, 证据包签名)</code> 分组统计并做平滑，不要用总体均值。</li>\n<li>不放外部链接、不做音频视频、不要求审核员联系你——审核员只看嵌入的内容。</li>\n<li>接受争议是节流阀而非认错；客户口头撤回也要照常提交证据，因为撤回的争议同样计数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"representment 文案策略与胜诉率","id":"representment-文案策略与胜诉率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：文案的三条硬规则","id":"核心概念-文案的三条硬规则"},{"level":3,"text":"对齐理由码","id":"对齐理由码"},{"level":3,"text":"控制长度","id":"控制长度"},{"level":3,"text":"定性反驳的模板","id":"定性反驳的模板"},{"level":2,"text":"胜诉率的估算与用法","id":"胜诉率的估算与用法"},{"level":3,"text":"从概率到经济决策","id":"从概率到经济决策"},{"level":3,"text":"概率估计的输入","id":"概率估计的输入"},{"level":2,"text":"高效与低效文案的对照","id":"高效与低效文案的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"接受争议也是一种策略","id":"接受争议也是一种策略"},{"level":3,"text":"部分退款场景的答复","id":"部分退款场景的答复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"应诉举证证据包组装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-representment/representment-evidence-package"},"next":{"title":"拒付前争议预警与主动退款（RDR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-representment/pre-dispute-rdr-ethoca"}}